#: ../../../rest/db-remoteneed-get.rst:2
msgid "GET /rest/db/remoteneed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-remoteneed-get.rst:6
msgid ""
"Takes the mandatory parameters ``folder`` and ``device``, and returns the "
"list of files which are needed by that remote device in order for it to "
"become in sync with the shared folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-remoteneed-get.rst:10
msgid ""
"The results can be paginated using the :ref:`common pagination parameters "
"<rest-pagination>`."
msgstr ""

